# Both images build from the repository root (backend/Dockerfile,
# frontend/Dockerfile), so this is the one list of what must never reach a
# layer. Without it `backend/.env` — real database and Redis credentials —
# `test.db` and the coverage dumps were copied by `COPY backend/ .` (IS-07).
.git
.github
.claude
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/coverage*.json
**/htmlcov
**/test.db
**/db.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3
backend/staticfiles
frontend/.next
frontend/coverage
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/test-results
backups
docs
openspec
